Scope: this licence covers the Navier–Stokes pages in papers/navier-stokes/ and
the Lean in lean-wrappers/ written for them. The paper "Finite-time blow-up for
the Navier–Stokes equations" and its Lean package are by Levent Alpöge and
Tristan Buckmaster (https://github.com/tristanbuckmaster/navier-stokes) and are
not covered by this licence. lean-wrappers/navier-stokes-theorem71/patches/
changes three of their files and keeps their lines as context.
